WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.560
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today, I’m&nbsp;
going to explain a science fiction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.360
thriller film called “Children Of Men.” 
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:18.320
The premise of the movie is set in 2027.&nbsp;
Female fertility has become non-existent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:23.840
for the past eighteen years, and doctors are lost&nbsp;
to explain the reason. With no women reproducing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:29.120
humankind has not had a new child born in eighteen&nbsp;
years, and the world is falling apart. Most of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:33.440
the world's societies have collapsed due to&nbsp;
war and paranoia of extinction of humans;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:37.920
African and East European countries collapse,&nbsp;
and the people migrate to other wealthy nations.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:42.960
The UK has become a police state because of the&nbsp;
increase in the number of illegal immigrants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.440
and the police have the authority&nbsp;
to arrest any they find. 
&nbsp;

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:49.920
At the beginning of the movie, we see&nbsp;
the news the world's youngest citizen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:55.120
Argentine Baby Diego, who was eighteen years&nbsp;
old had died. He was murdered by an angry fan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:59.920
when he refused to give them an autograph. 
The newscast is watched by a saddened and stunned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:05.600
crowd in a Fleet Street coffee shop; humankind is&nbsp;
facing the likelihood of its own extinction. A man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:10.320
named Theo Faron enters the coffee shop, seemingly&nbsp;
indifferent to the news story or the crowd.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:15.360
Just after he leaves and stops to add liquor to&nbsp;
his coffee, the shop is blown up by a bomb.
&nbsp;

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:21.600
The act is attributed to an underground guerrilla&nbsp;
group, the Fishes. Theo is shaken by the incident&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:26.000
and leaves work early, under the excuse&nbsp;
of being shaken by Baby Diego's death.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:31.600
He instead visits his friend, Jasper. The two&nbsp;
drive to a well-hidden forest home, where Japer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:36.560
lives with his catatonic wife, Janice. They live&nbsp;
a secluded life and grow cannabis in the place.
&nbsp;

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:41.840
The following day, while walking to work,&nbsp;
Theo is kidnapped by two men who put him in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:46.400
a van and drive off. The people reveal that&nbsp;
they are an organization called the fishes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:50.160
who protest against the British government to&nbsp;
provide equal rights to every immigrant. 
&nbsp;

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:56.720
It turns out the group is led by Theo’s ex-wife,&nbsp;
Julian. Julian and Theo had a son named Dylan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:01.920
who died in a flu pandemic twenty years ago,&nbsp;
the two had not seen each other since. She first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:06.080
tells him that the Fishes were not responsible&nbsp;
for the bombing of the cafe the previous day;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:09.520
then one of her group angrily claims&nbsp;
that the government bombed the cafe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:14.720
trying to create discontent for the Fishes.
Julian wants Theo to make fake transit papers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:18.880
for an illegal immigrant, with the help of&nbsp;
his cousin who works in a government sector.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:23.280
Theo visits his cousin and is able to get the&nbsp;
papers, but they specifically state that Theo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:28.480
himself must accompany this immigrant out of the&nbsp;
city. He agrees and he with Julian, her associate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:33.680
Luke, the immigrant Kee, and her midwife Miriam&nbsp;
drives to the southern coast of England together.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:37.600
On their way, they are stopped by a car&nbsp;
in flames in the middle of the road.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:42.480
Soon, a large mob of people attacks them.&nbsp;
Everyone panics, and Luke starts to drive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:46.640
the car in reverse. However, a person&nbsp;
in front of them shoots Julian dead. 
&nbsp;

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:50.560
As they flee the scene of the attack,&nbsp;
they are pulled over by the police.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:56.080
When asked for their papers, Luke kills both&nbsp;
policemen. A short funeral is held in the forest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.080 --> 00:03:01.840
for Julian. Theo breaks off temporarily from the&nbsp;
service and cries privately for Julian. Luke is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:05.920
able to find another car and drives them to a&nbsp;
safe house on a farm where the Fishes gather.
&nbsp;

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:11.440
Theo tells Kee that he is going to leave, and&nbsp;
the fishes can take care of her. However, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:16.480
starts to take off her clothes. Theo is stunned&nbsp;
when he sees that Kee is eight months pregnant.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:20.960
Everyone in the fishes knows this and claims&nbsp;
that it is a miracle. The group then discuss&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:25.840
what should be their next move, and Theo insists&nbsp;
they should make the pregnancy public. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:30.080
the fishes claim that the British government would&nbsp;
take Kee and her child away and use them for their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:34.800
own benefit. They leave the decision to Kee, who&nbsp;
agrees to stay in the custody of the Fishes.
&nbsp;

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:40.400
At night, Luke wakes up to a commotion outside,&nbsp;
and sneaks out to see two injured men arrive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:45.200
at the house. One of them is Julian’s&nbsp;
associate and a sociopath named Patric.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:49.600
He eavesdrops on Luke and Patric’s conversation,&nbsp;
and is horrified to figure out that Julian’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:54.000
murder and the riot were all planned by the&nbsp;
fishes. They want to use Kee’s baby for their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:59.040
own needs, presumably to make money off her.&nbsp;
Moreover, they plan to kill Theo the following&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:04.800
day. After hearing all this, Theo panics. 
He quickly goes into Kee’s and Miriam’s room and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:10.080
tells them that Luke was behind Julian’s death.&nbsp;
Before her death, Julian had told Kee to trust&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:15.040
Theo before everyone, so she believes him. He&nbsp;
takes the two women and sneaks out of the house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:20.880
Theo disables all of their other cars, gets the&nbsp;
women inside a car, and narrowly escapes them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:25.840
Theo then takes them to Jasper's house since it&nbsp;
is hidden and secluded. Arriving there, Jasper&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:30.720
is surprised to see Kee pregnant, and agrees to&nbsp;
help them. He makes arrangements for Kee to meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:35.440
a ship called the Tomorrow, a vessel belonging to&nbsp;
a group called the Human Project, a collection of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:40.720
scientists based in the Azores off Portugal, and&nbsp;
dedicated to restoring human fertility. They are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:45.920
the only people that will help Kee genuinely. The&nbsp;
following morning, the fishes somehow manage to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:51.120
find Jasper's home. This sets of an alarm and&nbsp;
alerts them. Theo quickly gets everyone in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:55.840
car to take them to Jasper’s friend, Syd, who will&nbsp;
help them get to the Tomorrow ship in a boat. 
&nbsp;

00:04:56.480 --> 00:05:02.480
Theo, Kee, and Miriam watch the fishes get to&nbsp;
Jasper from afar. When Jasper refuses to talk,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:07.440
they shoot him dead. Theo is frustrated and&nbsp;
saddened by his friend’s death, but gets inside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:11.920
the car and continues the mission anyway. The&nbsp;
three reach an abandoned school, and stay there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:17.120
until a car arrives in the compound. Inside the&nbsp;
car is Jasper’s friend, Syd, who happens to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:21.760
an immigration officer. The plan is to get the&nbsp;
three arrested as immigrants and send them to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:26.800
tomorrow ship in the immigrant bus. Syd takes them&nbsp;
to a refugee camp, where they see the military&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:31.200
killing the refugees one after another. Throughout&nbsp;
the way, Kee goes through contractions and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:36.800
whimpers in pain. Miriam, who was a gynecologist&nbsp;
before the infertility pandemic, helps Kee with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:42.160
the contractions. They successfully manage to&nbsp;
get on the refugee bus and head toward Bexhill.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:47.280
On the way, Kee’s water breaks, and she is about&nbsp;
to give birth. An immigrant officer comes inside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:52.080
the bus and asks what is wrong with her. Miriam&nbsp;
acts strange to get the officer’s attention off&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:57.200
Kee. She is arrested and taken off the bus, while&nbsp;
Kee and Theo reach Bexhill without detection.
&nbsp;

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:02.960
There, the two meet a woman named Marichka, who&nbsp;
takes them to an old rusty room for the night.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:07.040
As soon as they get inside, Kee’s contraction&nbsp;
gets worse and she starts giving birth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:12.320
Theo helps her with it, and within some time,&nbsp;
she gives birth to a beautiful little girl.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:16.000
The two happily celebrate. 
The following morning, they wake&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:20.480
up to Syd and Marichka banging on the door. They&nbsp;
tell them that the Fishes have broken into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:25.280
city and the national guard have been called&nbsp;
out to restore order. Outside, several riots&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:30.560
and shootouts are taking place. Kee tries to hide&nbsp;
her child from them, but they eventually see her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:34.640
Marichka tries to tell Theo and Kee to not&nbsp;
go with Syd because he is a bad person,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:39.120
but Syd threatens them with a gun. As it&nbsp;
turns out, Syd wants to turn Theo and Kee&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:44.640
in for money. Marichka attacks Syd and the three&nbsp;
narrowly escape. Amidst the riots and shootouts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:49.760
in the street, they manage to get to Marichka’s&nbsp;
family. They take great care of the baby and Kee,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:54.960
and agree to help them to get to a boat. 
They put Kee in a wheelchair and run outside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:59.280
The streets are in chaos, bullets fly&nbsp;
everywhere as they make their way to the boat.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:04.000
But before they get there, the fishes take Kee&nbsp;
away from them and kill Marichka‘s associate.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:09.280
However, the fishes are attacked by the British&nbsp;
forces, and Marichka and Theo manage to flee.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:12.960
They run amidst the shootouts and bomb&nbsp;
explosions, and are soon separated.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:18.400
Theo goes around the buildings, looking for Kee&nbsp;
and the child. He then goes upstairs and finds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:22.240
Kee with her crying baby, hiding in a corner&nbsp;
amongst other dead and injured people.
&nbsp;

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.320
Luke is on the other side, shooting&nbsp;
at the force from the window.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:30.640
As Theo attempts to take Kee and the baby&nbsp;
out, Luke opens fire in Theo's direction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:33.680
but Luke is killed a few moments&nbsp;
later, and they manage to escape.
&nbsp;

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:39.520
As they come out of the room, it explodes. The&nbsp;
two finally get out of the place with the baby,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:44.400
as everyone who sees them is stunned. The shooting&nbsp;
and explosions stop, as the people watch the baby&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:48.960
in awe. A soldier orders everyone to cease&nbsp;
the firing, some of them get down on their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:54.320
knees to pray. As the two get away, the shooting&nbsp;
starts again but they manage to flee and reunite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:59.840
with Marichka. Theo, Kee, and the baby get&nbsp;
into the boat and finally leave the harbor.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:04.560
They see fighter jets flying overhead, and Kee&nbsp;
is worried that they are late. Theo assures her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:08.720
that they will get to the tomorrow ship.&nbsp;
Kee sees blood and starts to freak out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:13.760
claiming that she is bleeding, but Theo says that&nbsp;
it is his, as it turns out that Luke had shot Theo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:19.200
before they ran away. An injured Theo teaches&nbsp;
Kee to burp her baby. As he whimpers in pain,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:22.400
Kee tells him that she will name her&nbsp;
baby Dylan, after Theo’s late son.
&nbsp;

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:27.840
Theo soon loses consciousness, as Kee&nbsp;
looks around and calls his name helplessly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:31.120
Just then, her face is lightened up to&nbsp;
see the tomorrow ship in front of them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:35.360
They have finally reached their&nbsp;
destination. Before the movie ends,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:39.840
we hear the sound of children laughing, suggesting&nbsp;
that the world has gone back to how it was.
&nbsp;

